    "image": "Use case: photorealistic-natural. Generate one vertical 9:16 film start frame, ideally 1080x1920. Strict first-person customer POV inside a small Polish secondhand electronics pawn shop. Image 1 is mandatory Wlodek facial identity, clothing brown check shirt and worn dark green knitted vest and amber glasses. Image 2 gives shop lighting and clutter, image 3 is floor-plan geometry only, image 4 is the small brown leather pouch design. Camera on customer south side of low glass counter looking north. Wlodek medium shot, leaning slightly forward behind counter looking straight at lens with impatient sharp appraising look, mouth closed before speaking, not smiling. Empty open brown pouch held at bottom of frame by two natural adult light-skinned hands in plain charcoal jacket sleeves, no jewelry. One person visible only Wlodek; never show customer body or face or reflection. Warm dusty practical lamps plus cyan/magenta accents, northern wall filled with old CRTs and stereos; matching reference, documentary pawnshop reality show cinematography. No subtitles, no graphics, no invented text, no watermark. Keep counter clear near hands, currencies can be out of frame; no green gems. Natural anatomy, strong immediately readable face and empty pouch. Single scene not collage.",
    "endFrameDescription": "",
